                                                "sense_id": "74ff7a50-e782-325c-b1e7-c80d48083b0c",
                                                "text": "Milk formed their chief diet, and this they were supposed to imbibe from the witch herself, from a third \"teat\" which had been made beneath the arm by a nip from the Devil's pincers."
                                            }
                                        ]
